<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-11-25T08:56:13.968Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Hostile gunmen seized a supermarket in Cartagena, taking at least 20 hostages, while Colombian security forces surrounded the site and later freed all hostages. Simultaneously, a car bomb detonated in a central Colombian city, destroying buildings and injuring more than 20 people, and another car bomb hit the governor's office in Meta. The Colombian president blamed ex-FARC rebels for the car bomb blast. The ELN carried out a drone strike on a police base, injuring three people including an infant. Violence remains high, with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/americas/colombia-farc-peace-deal.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/25/hostages-freed-colombia-security-forces-storm-cartagena-supermarket&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOQ2ZCdFdrT0VLWTdSQWJGZ0FYbExUNC1kbVh1RzE3U2V6ME4zU1ptaU5hOUp2YW5iY2JjRE5HcDNBWl8yS1o3NEZoZmVHQUU1WGo1TTNPYmFMN2JmS19ESFhSdWdhY09PM3Q5eXNsNUNBZ1pNUWhCNDBhWHkzVTgyN21IcHNYRVJYbTNONWdIRUo3dzQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/25/colombia-security-forces-storm-supermarket-where-hostages-are-being-held&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPUXk2MmFURDEwYmxvTFItajUwUC1YQWVXMDNYSXh5MTBDV1A5Y1ROb1FRajhCTVZQMkh6SnRXNmJENElGOWVnLXFqSWFqLXZleTRwc2RieDFvYzRGWDRHd2ZmclFVSzk3NFN0bmI3ZkJtbHJfNV81dWtoeWEzNmVvN3dpZ0Q4dF8zVjV3WU1xOXpPMHRUVnNzMjd1REx0ZHloZ29ZWjlNajVwSS1LeTBHek9WSmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/24/cartagena-colombia-hostages-supermarket&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https